sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CardView as User Card View
    participant CardController as UserCardController
    participant DB as Database

    User->>CardView: Open wallet
    CardView->>CardController: GET /User/Cards
    CardController->>DB: Load cards by UserId
    DB-->>CardController: Card list
    CardController-->>CardView: Show cards

    User->>CardView: Add or edit card
    CardView->>CardController: POST /User/Cards/Save
    CardController->>DB: Validate and save card
    DB-->>CardController: Saved
    CardController-->>CardView: Redirect with success message

    User->>CardView: Delete card
    CardView->>CardController: POST /User/Cards/Delete/{id}
    CardController->>DB: Remove selected card
    DB-->>CardController: Deleted
    CardController-->>CardView: Redirect with success message
